@startuml Data_Backup_Flow
!theme plain
title Use Case Flow: Data Backup

|Parent|
start
:Navigate to Settings or\nDashboard;
:Click **Backup Data**;

|System|
:POST /api/backup;
:Authenticate parent session;
:Query all family data:\n- children\n- tasks & assignments\n- completions\n- rewards & redemptions\n- coin/star transactions\n- evidence metadata\n- streaks, badges\n- messages, memories;
:Serialize to JSON;
:Return as downloadable file;

|Parent|
:Download backup file;
:Store securely;

stop
@enduml
